{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-19","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：比例与整数","englishTitle":"If four numbers be proportional, the number produced from the first and fourth will be equal to the number produced from the second and third; and, if the number produced from the first and fourth be equal to that produced from the second and third, the four numbers will be proportional.","book":7,"number":19,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.19","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.19/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":19,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-19@raw-016584c1f9175751","contentId":"euclid-7-19","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"016584c1f917575195397899f1fac031fd148c583d93e6bf357b5869d087ec85","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-19.statement","euclid-7-19.construction.1","euclid-7-19.construction.2","euclid-7-19.proof.1","euclid-7-19.proof.2","euclid-7-19.proof.3","euclid-7-19.proof.4","euclid-7-19.proof.5","euclid-7-19.proof.6","euclid-7-19.proof.7","euclid-7-19.proof.8","euclid-7-19.proof.9","euclid-7-19.proof.10","euclid-7-19.conclusion","euclid-7-19.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-19.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-19","revisionId":"euclid-7-19@raw-016584c1f9175751","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"12b848ffe48e866c799657ae4d95bbb1e7970db8ec47ff89c6da8e079db5e25d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If four numbers be proportional, the number produced from the first and fourth will be equal to the number produced from the second and third; and, if the number produced from the first and fourth be equal to that produced from the second and third, the four numbers will be proportional."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果四个数字为成比例,从第一和第二个数字延长的号码将等于从第二和第三个数字延长的号码;如果从第一和第二个数字延长的号码等于从第二和第三个数字延长的号码,则四个数字将为成比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-19.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-19","revisionId":"euclid-7-19@raw-016584c1f9175751","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e66fb8ef78aef215a1df5eb17fea5d252aeb314cc331b989a18a3d751a7ef450","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B, C, D be four numbers in proportion, so that, as A is to B, so is C to D; and let A by multiplying D make E, and let B by multiplying C make F; I say that E is equal to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A、B、C、D等比例为4个数字,A至B的比等于C至D的比;让A和D的产值为E,B和C的产值为F;我说,E等于F；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-19.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-7-19","revisionId":"euclid-7-19@raw-016584c1f9175751","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"061a92ba459fc4d76e70d64a25a12c28ec9765ea304def9e08ee48dcedbf2f7f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let A by multiplying C make G."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A和C的产物是G。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-19.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-19","revisionId":"euclid-7-19@raw-016584c1f9175751","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c973123d7db4b951e1f76a8a6e5db3133b63ef362ccf9e344edee1cbf0b040dc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since, then, A by multiplying C has made G, and by multiplying D has made E, the number A by multiplying the two numbers C, D has made G, E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,A乘以C, 使G, D乘以E, 使A乘以2,C, D 使G, E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-19.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-19","revisionId":"euclid-7-19@raw-016584c1f9175751","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"085dc7bba800107523f2dad8e00cd277a5c102da1868d786da4e952271de84e9","citations":["euclid-7-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as C is to D, so is G to E. [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,C比D等于G比E；C 与 D 之比等于 G 与 E 之比。 [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-19.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-19","revisionId":"euclid-7-19@raw-016584c1f9175751","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"32d43d5ffbd57f14b27632e1920576aaef16cdae59a22be06cf078efda7df9c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as C is to D, so is A to B; therefore also, as A is to B, so is G to E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,C对D的比等于A对B的比;因此,A对B的比等于G对E的比；C 与 D 之比等于 A 与 B 之比；A 与 B 之比等于 G 与 E 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-19.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-7-19","revisionId":"euclid-7-19@raw-016584c1f9175751","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d85141a10614c0f3104b80cc2e7d664a1d04857f646827b903ccfb11baa5f554","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since A by multiplying C has made G, but, further, B has also by multiplying C made F, the two numbers A, B by multiplying a certain number C have made G, F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"再来从A到C乘以G、B乘以C,F,2号A,B乘以C,G,F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-19.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-7-19","revisionId":"euclid-7-19@raw-016584c1f9175751","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"900da3b65c2e3abc30fc022aab7a15527f03135006d33b25de9ef0cf81699edc","citations":["euclid-7-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as A is to B, so is G to F. [[VII. 18](/principles/euclid-7-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A比B等于G比F；A 与 B 之比等于 G 与 F 之比。 [[VII. 18](/principles/euclid-7-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-19.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-7-19","revisionId":"euclid-7-19@raw-016584c1f9175751","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7238b160cc807a85c2db103666016f9cbaa0a1f9678a8da66dba9421bd82b349","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But further, as A is to B, so is G to E also; therefore also, as G is to E, so is G to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,A比B的比例也等于G比E;因此,G比E的比例等于G比F；A 与 B 之比等于 G 与 E 之比；G 与 E 之比等于 G 与 F 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-19.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-7-19","revisionId":"euclid-7-19@raw-016584c1f9175751","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"499a8d06cd7f1ec38e274b54289bbc9f282958cfe4de5c5021ed7ff6f1351b82","citations":["euclid-5-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore G has to each of the numbers E, F the same ratio; therefore E is equal to F. [cf. [V. 9](/principles/euclid-5-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,G对E、F的比例相同;因此,E等于F [cf. [V. 9](/principles/euclid-5-9)"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-19.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-7-19","revisionId":"euclid-7-19@raw-016584c1f9175751","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7da41f027547bdd7d0cf7211612c29dbec4c7a482942becbeb9a004cc720b1c0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, let E be equal to F; I say that, as A is to B, so is C to D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,E等于F;我说,A比B等于C比D；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-19.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-7-19","revisionId":"euclid-7-19@raw-016584c1f9175751","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"82037ef9e4af1e36bd673367d188f0534f8d880f67be459f054e48cf0a38de69","citations":["euclid-5-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, with the same construction, since E is equal to F, therefore, as G is to E, so is G to F. [cf. [V. 7](/principles/euclid-5-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样的建筑,由于E等于F,G对E的比等于G对F的比；G 与 E 之比等于 G 与 F 之比。 [cf. [V. 7](/principles/euclid-5-7)"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-19.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-7-19","revisionId":"euclid-7-19@raw-016584c1f9175751","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ed06ed7cc3f3ad41ed861388af019d4df726c54975f1c6501c039fc8dcbdc614","citations":["euclid-7-17","euclid-7-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as G is to E, so is C to D, [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)] and, as G is to F, so is A to B. [[VII. 18](/principles/euclid-7-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,G对E的比等于C对D的比,G对F的比等于A对B的比；G 与 E 之比等于 C 与 D 之比；G 与 F 之比等于 A 与 B 之比。 [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)] [[VII. 18](/principles/euclid-7-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-19.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-19","revisionId":"euclid-7-19@raw-016584c1f9175751","order":13,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5c1fb59f6b79ff69190e059b664b5f50f7de8a16263d31aec4b43dad2567d6d0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore also, as A is to B, so is C to D. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A对B的比也等于C对D的比；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-19.source","contentId":"euclid-7-19","revisionId":"euclid-7-19@raw-016584c1f9175751","order":14,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"20c10acf4b256f530f52462ef06c7797bc8b4d24506f5b3fa210b48d6305a526","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.19/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.19\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-19:euclid-7-17:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-19","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-19.proof.2","euclid-7-19.proof.10"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-17","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.19","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.per